  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and IGRA in BCG-vaccinated individuals without active TB: DST 5mm vs QFT 97.18% (Starshinova 2018, children) and C-TST vs T-SPOT.TB 97.44% (Xu 2021, adults). The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 97.22% (93.96–98.75) across 216 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وIGRA لدى الأفراد الملقَّحين بلقاح BCG غير المصابين بالسل النشط: DST 5 مم مقابل QFT 97.18% (Starshinova 2018، أطفال)، وC-TST مقابل T-SPOT.TB 97.44% (Xu 2021، بالغون). ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 97.22% (93.96–98.75) لدى 216 مشاركاً.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
